sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as IT Admin
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    Note over BE,DB: Writing an entry -- triggered internally by other actions (never a direct user request)
    Note over BE: e.g. ACCOUNT_CREATED, ROLE_CHANGED, VACANCY_CLOSED, PASSWORD_RESET, BACKUP_COMPLETED
    BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(eventType, actorId, targetId, metadata)

    Note over Admin,DB: Viewing the log
    Admin->>FE: Open Audit Log page
    FE->>BE: GET /api/audit-logs?eventType=&from=&to=&page=
    BE->>DB: findMany AuditLog with filters, ordered by createdAt desc, paginated
    BE->>BE: Map raw eventType codes to human-readable labels (EVENT_TYPE mapping)
    BE-->>FE: 200 {entries, totalCount}
    FE-->>Admin: Render table with actor, action, target, timestamp

    Note over Admin,DB: Filtering
    Admin->>FE: Choose event type / date range
    FE->>BE: GET /api/audit-logs?eventType=ROLE_CHANGED&from=...&to=...
    BE->>DB: Re-run query with filters applied
    BE-->>FE: 200 filtered {entries, totalCount}
